00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:44.459
It became like a thing where like I just wanted to prove to myself having the background of like my trauma.

00:09:45.087 --> 00:09:53.691
As a kid and having PTSD and not being able to be around any kind of like physical conflict to like going and being in a ring with someone and just like straight beating the shit out of each other,

00:09:53.791 --> 00:09:56.712
it felt like I was like I was making myself feel worthy.

00:09:58.332 --> 00:09:59.833
I started boxing three years ago.

00:10:00.053 --> 00:10:01.514
Whenever I went for the first couple of times,

00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:05.095
like I just loved the working out and then I loved feeling like I was like a part of something.

00:10:05.635 --> 00:10:07.296
My coach's name is Giovanni.

00:10:07.556 --> 00:10:08.397
He's just the best.

00:10:08.917 --> 00:10:09.717
Dude's like a dad to me.

00:10:12.258 --> 00:10:14.299
I exercise four times a week.

00:10:14.559 --> 00:10:16.000
really heavily at the gym.

00:10:16.781 --> 00:10:19.884
I got up to like a really unhealthy weight because I stopped going to boxing.

00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:23.507
So like I'm at the age now where I know that my metabolism has slowed down.

00:10:23.787 --> 00:10:27.050
I definitely know that I have to maintain physical activity to keep myself fit.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.071
Yeah,

00:10:28.072 --> 00:10:28.351
it's okay.

00:10:28.351 --> 00:10:29.532
I'm on my terrible,

00:10:29.692 --> 00:10:29.952
awful,

00:10:30.193 --> 00:10:31.153
carb-filled diet.

00:10:31.193 --> 00:10:32.835
Come on.

00:10:32.836 --> 00:10:33.275
A little bit more.

00:10:33.375 --> 00:10:34.096
Just a little bit more.

00:10:34.757 --> 00:10:37.559
I went to the doctor for a physical five weeks ago now.

00:10:37.719 --> 00:10:38.400
It's a new doctor,

