then you can't get the help you need.

00:11:17.377 --> 00:11:20.398
I feel like a lot of men think that's a weakness when it's not.

00:11:21.058 --> 00:11:21.318
You know,

00:11:21.378 --> 00:11:22.258
if there's a problem,

00:11:22.839 --> 00:11:24.399
the weakness is ignoring it.

00:11:24.887 --> 00:11:25.127
Let's go,

00:11:25.207 --> 00:11:25.448
let's go.

00:11:25.548 --> 00:11:25.988
Finish strong,

00:11:26.048 --> 00:11:26.529
finish strong.

