That's all you got?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:29.191
Not bad,

00:11:29.231 --> 00:11:29.491
kid,

00:11:29.492 --> 00:11:30.072
not bad.

00:11:30.092 --> 00:11:31.653
You still going to work today?

00:11:31.673 --> 00:11:32.314
Yes,

00:11:32.334 --> 00:11:32.514
sir.

