00:11:49.609 --> 00:11:51.831
unbiased stance whenever I try new foods.

00:11:52.091 --> 00:11:55.552
It's like the stepping stone to being able to do the things that I want to do easier.

00:11:56.192 --> 00:11:59.873
It's been about two years since I've been to a therapist's office.

