00:12:18.799 --> 00:12:19.279
it was very,

00:12:19.479 --> 00:12:20.179
very difficult.

00:12:20.939 --> 00:12:27.442
It has proved to be very difficult to find any reasonable therapist who takes my insurance.

00:12:27.462 --> 00:12:30.643
Insurance companies seem to think that mental health is like a luxury,

00:12:31.324 --> 00:12:31.644
you know?

00:12:31.645 --> 00:12:33.585
Hello.

00:12:33.665 --> 00:12:33.785
Austin.

00:12:33.786 --> 00:12:34.925
How you doing?

00:12:34.945 --> 00:12:35.726
Good to meet you.

00:12:35.727 --> 00:12:36.246
Nice to meet you.

